==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[inertial]] [[frame of reference]]|inertial frames of reference}}

# {{lb|en|physics}} A [[frame of reference]] that is [[stationary]] [[relative]] to a [[body]] moving at [[constant]] [[velocity]] and on which no [[force]] is being [[exert]]ed.

